[E0367] Error: a shift by 8 of a `u8`, which is 8 bits wide
    ╭─[ err/537_what_does_not_widen/main.wip:25:24 ]
    │
 25 │     val shifted = byte << 8
    │                        ─┬
    │                         ╰── the amount is taken modulo 8
    │
    │ Help: widen the value first
    │
    │ Note: a shift's amount is taken modulo the width of what is shifted, so a shift by the whole width leaves the value as it was
────╯
